      "writtenOn": "2026-11-04T02:12:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So what happens if the dma_buf is uncached, like Android\u0027s `system-uncached` heap?  Doesn\u0027t this ioctl potentially return the wrong data in that case, due to the cache not being coherent?  If so, shouldn\u0027t it return an error instead?",
